max-context-size: MAX_CONTEXT_SIZE = 2264

Classification: profile setting.

The capacity of TPM2B_CONTEXT_DATA is a profile choice; 2264 octets is tpm-
rs's value (the harness assumes it as well, see
testing/src/bin/shared/ffi.rs), so that the same context blobs are accepted
or rejected with TPM_RC_SIZE.

diff --git a/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h b/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
--- a/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
+++ b/src/TpmProfile_Misc.h
@@ -85,7 +85,9 @@
 #define NUM_POLICY_PCR_GROUP       1
 #define NUM_AUTHVALUE_PCR_GROUP    1
 //#define MAX_CONTEXT_SIZE           2168
-#define MAX_CONTEXT_SIZE           2680	/* kgold for RSA-3072 */
+// tpm-rs differential testing: as mstpm20 (no RSA-3072; the harness assumes
+// a 2264-byte context blob capacity, see testing/src/bin/shared/ffi.rs).
+#define MAX_CONTEXT_SIZE           2264
 #define MAX_DIGEST_BUFFER          1024
 #define MAX_NV_INDEX_SIZE          2048
 #define MAX_NV_BUFFER_SIZE         1024
